# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Harvested data — DO NOT COMMIT.
#
# The certificates and the QR pages carry business owners' names, personal
# mobile numbers and personal email addresses. The portal publishes them so
# contractor credentials can be verified; that does not make them ours to
# republish on a public repo, where they would be indexed and scraped.
# Keep your output local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
